# Jian (slot 0) and Rufus (slot 1) in the party, in the first Delrich Temple battle, for the skill plans.
# Both have their HP pinned to 999 so they live through any number of rounds; their other stats are left as
# the save has them (level 1), so stat changes show. Field records are 0x5C each from 0x020B4658: Jian's HP
# at 0x020B4668 / 0x020B466C; Rufus's record is at 0x020B47C8 (level index +0x0C = 0x020B47D4, HP +0x10 /
# +0x14). Battlers and stat records 0 and 1 are theirs in the battle. Built like party_gabryel.plan (the
# pins are repeated because warp6 drops them).
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B466C 999
pin u16 0x020B4668 999
pin u16 0x020B47DC 999
pin u16 0x020B47D8 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 4
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
include warp6
pin u16 0x020B466C 999
pin u16 0x020B4668 999
pin u16 0x020B47DC 999
pin u16 0x020B47D8 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 4
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
